<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,363 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,363 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,363 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX).</p>
<p>				    Sept 5		  Sept 4</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,363		   5,363</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	7.01		    21.33</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
